A directory argument and a glob argument together give one glob view listing the files of both in path order.
== args
input/src
input/docs/**/*.md
== file input/src/a.md
---
description: A summary.
---
# a
== file input/docs/guide.md
---
summary: Guide summary.
---
== stdout
glob view: input/src input/docs/**/*.md
input/docs/guide.md (3 lines): summary: "Guide summary."
input/src/a.md (4 lines): description: "A summary."
== stderr
== exit 0
